astry Shop Closes Its Doors Soon", "url": "https://www.hawaiinewsnow.com/story/6584356/chinese-pastry-shop-closes-its-doors-soon"}, {"title": "Accessibility links", "url": "https://www.voanews.com/a/hong-kong-s-last-hand-painted-porcelain-factory/6634549.html"}, {"title": "digital release.kron4", "url": "https://digital-release.kron4.com/?p=1678232"}, {"title": "Hong Kong Factory Last to Carry On a Disappearing Art", "url": "https://learningenglish.voanews.com/amp/hong-kong-factory-last-to-carry-on-a-disappearing-art/6636228.html"}, {"title": "hong kongs king of umbrellas closes 183 year old family shop", "url": "https://thesun.my/asia/hong-kongs-king-of-umbrellas-closes-183-year-old-family-shop/"}, {"title": "Accessibility links", "url": "https://voa.pangea-cms.com/preview/en-US/a/hong-kong-s-last-hand-painted-porcelain-factory/6634549.html"}]}, "我没有找到关于\"中国最后一家点翠工场关闭\"的报道,搜索结果中没有提到具体的关闭事件或年份。\n\n搜索到的相关内容只有一篇2026年2月的羊城晚报文章,它讲的是点翠工艺本身。该文介绍说点翠工艺是一项始于战国时期的中国传统金银首饰制作工艺,并指出我国已有成熟的仿点翠工艺,用染色鹅毛、蓝色缎面丝带、养殖孔雀羽毛都能达到很好的效果。这说明现代工艺已经转向替代材料,但文章没有提到传统工场的存续或关闭情况。\n\n其余结果涉及的是香港的老字号,例如林香茶室、永东中国瓷厂和雨伞修理店,与点翠无关。\n\n如果你需要确切信息,可以试试以下方向:用\"点翠 非遗 工坊 停业\"或\"点翠 最后 传承人\"等关键词搜索,或查阅北京、广州等地非遗保护机构的相关公告。"], "durationSeconds": 7.150510375, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01M5fbgcqKkkcDnQbjmsnJkK", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
