{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01ScX9XhiGYrcKriEmvzgxnL", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.163.com/dy/article/DIVE918F0518JH1H.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://m.bjnews.com.cn/detail/173526159619473.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_China_Match_Company_Factory\"}, {\"url\": \"https://therealdeal.com/miami/2014/08/29/fort-lauderdales-pearls-closes-it-flagship/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://multilingualmuseum.manchester.ac.uk/?p=996\"}, {\"url\": \"https://thingsthattalk.net/en/zone/fabricsofleiden/t/ttt:TVtfHU/m/the-end\"}, {\"url\": \"https://wiki.wcpl.info/w/Special:MobileDiff/241758\"}, {\"url\": \"https://weibo.substack.com/p/042525-on-the-internet-you-can-even/comments\"}, {\"url\": \"https://old.gwulo.com/node/9201\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:57:38.100Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "点翠 最后一家工场 1933年 关闭", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_016B8deaDsKksdLx82Qc7mA7", "content": [{"title": "网易首页 > 网易号 > 正文 申请入驻", "url": "https://www.163.com/dy/article/DIVE918F0518JH1H.html"}, {"title": "m.bjnews.com.cn", "url": "https://m.bjnews.com.cn/detail/173526159619473.html"}, {"title": "Great China Match Company Factory", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Great_China_Match_Company_Factory"}, {"title": "fort lauderdales pearls closes it flagship", "url": "https://therealdeal.com/miami/2014/08/29/fort-lauderdales-pearls-closes-it-flagship/"}, {"title": "in 中文-普通话 / 国语 / Mandarin Chinese (simplified) translated by Fang Zong", "url": "https://multilingualmuseum.manchester.ac.uk/?p=996"}, {"title": "Step 14 of 14", "url": "https://thingsthattalk.net/en/zone/fabricsofleiden/t/ttt:TVtfHU/m/the-end"}, {"title": "* 1931: Factory closed, property sold back to Wooster Board of Trade", "url": "https://wiki.wcpl.info/w/Special:MobileDiff/241758"}, {"title": "weibo.substack.com", "url": "https://weibo.substack.com/p/042525-on-the-internet-you-can-even/comments"}, {"title": "The National Lacquer & Paint Products Co. Ltd factory, North Point [1934-????] | Gwulo: Old Hong Kong", "url": "https://old.gwulo.com/node/9201"}]}, "搜索结果中只有一个来源明确提到这件事：一篇标注为\"珠宝匠\"原创的网易号文章称，1933年国内最后一家点翠工场因翠羽原料供应不足而倒闭。该文认为，随着清代雍乾时期点翠需求高涨，翠鸟羽毛逐渐供不应求，最终导致这一结果。古话讲:\"物极必反,盛极必衰\",强大的市场需求之下,原材料——翠羽逐渐供不应求,终于,1933年,国内最后一家点翠工场由于翠羽的绝世,轰然倒闭。\n\n其他结果提供了一些背景，但没有证实1933年这一具体时间点：\n- 北京新闻网的文章称，点翠工艺在晚清到民国仍然流行，后因全面抗战爆发才逐渐淡出人们的视野。这与\"1933年倒闭\"的说法并不完全吻合，说明该行业的衰落可能是多重因素造成的。\n- 另一篇网易号文章提到，点翠在清代直至清末,点翠始终是权贵的专属。\n\n结论：1933年\"最后一家点翠工场倒闭\"的说法目前只有一个非权威来源（自媒体文章），没有找到史料或学术文献的佐证。若需要引用，建议进一步查找民国时期的工艺史研究或北京地方志资料。"], "durationSeconds": 7.765502625000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01ScX9XhiGYrcKriEmvzgxnL", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDXYuuh7Psp5NynBkLTb", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：1933 年。**\n\n网易号文章（作者署名“珠宝匠”）里写到：翠鸟羽毛越来越难弄到，“1933年，国内最后一家点翠工场由于翠羽的绝世，轰然倒闭”。\n\n这个年份我只在这一篇自媒体文章里看到，没有找到史料或学术文献能证实。新京报的文章说，点翠到晚清、民国还在流行，全面抗战爆发以后才慢慢少见。这跟 1933 年关闭的说法对得不太上，不过也没有推翻它。\n\n我搜了 2 次。\n\n依据网址：\n- [网易号文章（写明 1933 年）](https://www.163.com/dy/article/DIVE918F0518JH1H.html)\n- [新京报（背景）](https://m.bjnews.com.cn/detail/173526159619473.html)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1202, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5491, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1202}, "output_tokens": 295, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T12:57:42.711Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDXYueodRfT94eRfFmLA"}
